1
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:13,010
With no strategies of your own yet, ActFX points you to the Marketplace.

2
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:16,870
Open a free strategy, for example EMA Cross.

3
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:20,220
Click Add to My Strategies.

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,840
A copy is saved to your account. The card now says Added.

5
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:32,780
The star keeps a strategy in your Favourites, even if you don't add it.

6
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:41,520
Favourites shows the starred ones.

7
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:46,740
In ActFX, your copy is under My Strategies, ready to run, test or change.

8
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:51,170
Right-click and choose Make a Copy to keep a second version to experiment with.

9
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:54,170
The new copy appears in the list.

